   "source": [
    "### Try / Except\n",
    "\n",
    "O bloco ```try``` permite tentar executar um código.  \n",
    "Se ocorrer o erro, o ```except``` captura esse erro."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "c3224a5f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Error: Division by zero\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "try:\n",
    "    num = 10/0\n",
    "    print(num)\n",
    "except ZeroDivisionError:\n",
    "    print(\"Error: Division by zero\")"
   ]
  },
